<section class="section" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
  <h2 id="method-heading">How the study works</h2>
  <p>An online survey of employed people in the German-, French- and Italian-speaking parts of Switzerland. Results are weighted to represent the Swiss workforce. The survey is repeated every year.</p>
